        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nuice Industries is a management/tycoon game with a playful sci-fi take on the oil rush theme. Excel in the race for resources, whether by exercising your management skills, harnessing the unusual weather of this alien planet, or launching both sneaky and violent attacks to sabotage your competitors’ operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518730/extras/1311ca74d40e5cb80415e44b88b2ddd3.poster.avif?t=1782132927\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518730/extras/1311ca74d40e5cb80415e44b88b2ddd3.webm?t=1782132927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518730/extras/1311ca74d40e5cb80415e44b88b2ddd3.mp4?t=1782132927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might be asking, “What is Nuice good for anyway? What do these companies do with this highly nuclear material?” Well, we can’t give you that information out of concern for our own personal health. Rest assured, though, that if you manage to buy enough fuel to earn your seat in the shuttle, you won’t have to find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518730/extras/4d5bdfe69afb46049f038a86ef617cca.poster.avif?t=1782132927\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518730/extras/4d5bdfe69afb46049f038a86ef617cca.webm?t=1782132927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518730/extras/4d5bdfe69afb46049f038a86ef617cca.mp4?t=1782132927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan and lay down complex piping networks to exploit Nuice, Gold and other resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broaden and develop your Nuice drilling and discovery capabilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch devastating attacks at your opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your race against time by keeping Nuice reserves until you find the right moment to cash out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart and outbid your competitors to guarantee your spot among the victors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create profit optimization strategies, such as storing lightning via batteries and enriching your Nuice reserves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entirely procedurally-generated levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer campaign where you must invest your profits in fuel for a space shuttle to escape to the next planet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice mode where you set your own parameters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer campaign with up to 6 players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518730/extras/5d97e4c151abaadc5bb6708faa9186d4.poster.avif?t=1782132927\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518730/extras/5d97e4c151abaadc5bb6708faa9186d4.webm?t=1782132927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518730/extras/5d97e4c151abaadc5bb6708faa9186d4.mp4?t=1782132927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nuice Industries is a management/tycoon game with a playful sci-fi take on the oil rush theme. Excel in the race for resources, whether by exercising your management skills, harnessing the unusual weather of this alien planet, or launching both sneaky and violent attacks to sabotage your competitors’ operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518730/extras/1311ca74d40e5cb80415e44b88b2ddd3.poster.avif?t=1782132927\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518730/extras/1311ca74d40e5cb80415e44b88b2ddd3.webm?t=1782132927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518730/extras/1311ca74d40e5cb80415e44b88b2ddd3.mp4?t=1782132927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might be asking, “What is Nuice good for anyway? What do these companies do with this highly nuclear material?” Well, we can’t give you that information out of concern for our own personal health. Rest assured, though, that if you manage to buy enough fuel to earn your seat in the shuttle, you won’t have to find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518730/extras/4d5bdfe69afb46049f038a86ef617cca.poster.avif?t=1782132927\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518730/extras/4d5bdfe69afb46049f038a86ef617cca.webm?t=1782132927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518730/extras/4d5bdfe69afb46049f038a86ef617cca.mp4?t=1782132927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan and lay down complex piping networks to exploit Nuice, Gold and other resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Broaden and develop your Nuice drilling and discovery capabilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch devastating attacks at your opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your race against time by keeping Nuice reserves until you find the right moment to cash out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart and outbid your competitors to guarantee your spot among the victors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create profit optimization strategies, such as storing lightning via batteries and enriching your Nuice reserves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entirely procedurally-generated levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Singleplayer campaign where you must invest your profits in fuel for a space shuttle to escape to the next planet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice mode where you set your own parameters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer campaign with up to 6 players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518730/extras/5d97e4c151abaadc5bb6708faa9186d4.poster.avif?t=1782132927\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518730/extras/5d97e4c151abaadc5bb6708faa9186d4.webm?t=1782132927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518730/extras/5d97e4c151abaadc5bb6708faa9186d4.mp4?t=1782132927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
